{{PageBanner|Matatabi en.jpg}}
'''Catfruit''' (マタタビ, ''Matatabi'', '''Actinidia''') is an item added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]] of both [[The Battle Cats]] and [[Nyanko Daisensou]]. This item allows you to evolve certain [[Cat Units]] to their [[True Form]] and [[Ultra Form]] using different amounts of Catfruit. The first source of Catfruit is unlocked by clearing the 3rd chapter of [[Empire of Cats]].

==Introduction==
'''Catfruit''' is a drop-chance item obtainable by clearing related Growing Stages that appear in [[Legend Stages]] for a period of time. Growing Catfruit will always be available as of [[Version 15.2 Update|Version 15.2]]. Catfruit is separated into two tiers of rarities, Seeds and Fruit, with nine different types: '''Green, Purple, Red, Blue, Yellow, Epic, Aku, Elder, and Gold'''.

