As of [[Version 15.2 Update|Version 15.2]], [[Growing Catfruit]] will always be in [[Legend Stages]]. There are 5 different stages, each of which will drop the corresponding Catfruit. There is a small chance of getting an epic catfruit. There is also a small chance to get [[Catfruit Jubilee]]. Furthermore, [[Catfruit Buffet]] appears every Wednesday and throughout every fourth weekend. Other Catfruit types tend to have more peculiar schedules for their stages. Each stage consists of enemies of a certain type. The maps appear in a cycle as follows:

