==Stage Explanations==
===Growing Catfruit===
[[Growing Catfruit]] has five stages that each have a chance to drop a Catfruit seed or full fruit of one of the main five colors, and carries a rare chance to drop a Epic Catfruit. There is also a chance to enter Catfruit Jubilee. Catfruit Jubilee does not allow the player to bring any [[Battle Items|items]] except for Speed Ups and forces the player to use the last formation from the previous stage, as it is a [[Continuation Stage]]. The chance of obtaining a Catfruit from Catfruit Jubilee are as follows:

