==Evolving Units Using Catfruit==
The main usage of Catfruit and Behemoth Stones is to unlock certain units' [[True Form]]s and [[Ultra Form]]s. Each unit requires different amounts of evolution materials along with XP to evolve. The requirements for each relevant cat are listed in their respective wiki pages.

Typically, if possible, cats will require more Catfruit of their target traits. [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]] → Ramen Cat is a good example, requiring more Yellow Catfruit due to his anti-Angel specialization.

